<lb n="16"/>und Ine in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billichmeßigen</unclear> begeren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetwillig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuvernemen</unclear>, sonder auch
